{
  "name": "AI Analysis App — Backend v1",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI Analysis App — n8n Backend v1\n\n### Setup Checklist\n1. Replace `YOUR_SUPABASE_URL` with your Supabase project URL (e.g. `https://abcxyz.supabase.co`)\n2. Replace `YOUR_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY` with your Supabase anon/public key\n3. Set your OpenAI credential on `analyze_image` and `OpenAI Chat Model` nodes\n4. Replace `YOUR_ANALYSIS_PROMPT_HERE` in `analyze_image` with your actual AI prompt\n5. Replace the schema in `Structured Output Parser` with your output field definitions\n\n### Supabase Table — Run this SQL in Supabase SQL Editor\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE analyses (\n  id UUID DEFAULT gen_random_uuid() PRIMARY KEY,\n  user_id UUID REFERENCES auth.users(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\n  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now(),\n  result JSONB,\n  input_metadata JSONB\n);\nALTER TABLE analyses ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;\nCREATE POLICY \"Users see own data\" ON analyses\n  FOR ALL USING (auth.uid() = user_id);\n```\n\n### What Your Frontend Sends\n```json\nPOST /webhook/ai-analyze\nContent-Type: application/json\n\n{\n  \"token\": \"<supabase_session_jwt>\",\n  \"image\": \"<base64_encoded_image_string>\",\n  \"mimeType\": \"image/jpeg\",\n  \"filename\": \"upload.jpg\"\n}\n```\n\n### Response Your Frontend Receives\n```json\n{ \"success\": true, \"id\": \"<uuid>\", \"data\": { ...your AI result... } }\n```\n\n### Auth Errors Return\n```json\n{ \"error\": \"Unauthorized\", \"message\": \"Invalid or missing authentication token\" }\n```",
        "height": 1000,
        "width": 2100,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [-120, -480],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "name": "Setup Guide"
    },
